    "## Importing Libraries\n",
    "\n",
    "I prefer keeping all the imports in one place. I think it makes the code cleaner and easier to follow.\n",
    "\n",
    "I've rewritten this part several times as the project changed and I figured out which libraries I actually needed.\n",
    "\n",
    "To install the main dependencies, run:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "pip install pandas numpy nltk emoji matplotlib seaborn wordcloud scipy scikit-learn\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "The NLTK resources used for tokenization, POS tagging, and lemmatization can be downloaded with:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "import nltk\n",
    "\n",
    "for resource in [\n",
    "    \"punkt\",\n",
    "    \"punkt_tab\",\n",
    "    \"averaged_perceptron_tagger\",\n",
    "    \"averaged_perceptron_tagger_eng\",\n",
    "    \"wordnet\",\n",
    "    \"omw-1.4\"\n",
    "]:\n",
    "    nltk.download(resource)\n",
    "```\n"
   ]
  },
