    "## Loading the Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "In this section, I loaded the Enron-Spam dataset from the CSV file `enron_spam_data.csv`. The dataset contains emails exchanged in the Enron business environment. Some of them are normal emails (ham), while others are spam.\n",
    "\n",
    "My goal is to use these emails to build a model that can distinguish spam from normal messages.\n",   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "54a032cc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "--------------------------------"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
