   "id": "1dcd8bc1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Analyzing Uppercase Letters\n",
    "\n",
    "I also want to investigate the ratio of uppercase letters in each email. I have a feeling this could be an interesting feature, especially if there are noticeable differences between spam and ham emails."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "25c9d2d6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "def uppercase_ratio(text):\n",
    "    text = str(text)\n",
    "    letters = [c for c in text if c.isalpha()]\n",
    "\n",
    "    if not letters:\n",
    "        return 0\n",
    "\n",
    "    uppercase = sum(c.isupper() for c in letters)\n",
    "\n",
    "    return uppercase / len(letters)\n",
    "\n",
    "data[\"uppercase_ratio\"] = data[\"Message\"].apply(uppercase_ratio)\n",
    "data[\"uppercase_ratio\"] = data[\"uppercase_ratio\"] * 100\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "a599b7a1",
   "metadata": {},
