   "source": [
    "### Hyperparameter Tuning\n",
    "\n",
    "At this stage, I used `GridSearchCV` to find the best value for the `C` parameter in `LinearSVC`.\n",
    "\n",
    "`C` controls how much the model is penalized for making mistakes and helps balance overfitting and keeping the model simple.\n",
    "\n",
    "I split the training data into 4 folds using `StratifiedGroupKFold`. This keeps duplicate messages together while also trying to preserve the class distribution in each fold.\n",
    "\n",
    "The text vectorizer and numerical scaler are inside the pipeline, so they are fitted separately within each training fold.\n"
   ]
  },
